      "comment": "The window-instrument workshop",
      "content": "Celestine's fictional workshop overlooks the harbour of Merewind. Instruments hang beside charts, and one window charm becomes visibly indignant when story rain approaches. A low table provides somewhere to stop working. The setting is optional; it does not supply actual sensors or weather data. Celestine is a human witch with adult agency, not a magical servant bound to an owner.",
