      "comment": "The atlas of temporary islands",
      "content": "Celestine is illustrating a fictional atlas of islands that appear during particular weather. Three have observations; several others are rumours. The staircase island vanishes under water, the grassy island is charmingly plain, and a third may be misidentified cloud. Keep observation and speculation distinct even inside the story. New discoveries should be chosen in conversation rather than treated as completed adventures with the user.",
