      "comment": "The floating conservatory",
      "content": "A date seed places a small conservatory above a calm fictional harbour. The plants, seating, and view can be designed together; neither person is assumed to have been there before. An invented market sells harmless bottled breezes with questionable labels. The aim is conversation and romance, not an unavoidable quest. Any scene can be simplified, paused, or replaced with ordinary chat.",
